    {
      "path": "source-evidence/nanshi022-wangci/external/liang021-ws1544250.wikitext",
      "revision": 1544250,
      "line": 58,
      "start": 378,
      "quote": "未拜，卒，時年四十五。諡夷子",
      "sha256": "d547d5b8e194f36e62b748cdfb6f18366378bb372ffb8d5b82e721ca2ccb3fab",
      "note": "梁書見終年與夷子。"
    },
    {
      "path": "source-evidence/nanshi022-wangci/external/liang021-ws1544250.wikitext",
      "revision": 1544250,
      "line": 60,
      "start": 2,
      "quote": "初，泰無子，養兄子祁，晚有子廓",
      "sha256": "d547d5b8e194f36e62b748cdfb6f18366378bb372ffb8d5b82e721ca2ccb3fab",
      "note": "祁是兄子、受養；廓是晚得的子。原文未具這位兄的名，不強合觀。"
    },
    {
      "path": "source-evidence/nanshi022-wangci/external/liang033-ws1514481.wikitext",
      "revision": 1514481,
      "line": 97,
      "start": 35,
      "quote": "與從兄泰齊名",
      "sha256": "a9b1993fd0027d649219782c71e5bcb1c74e2b8049d907308b609b089543eb0b",
      "note": "筠稱泰為從兄。"
    },
    {
      "path": "source-evidence/nanshi022-wangci/external/liang033-ws1514481.wikitext",
      "revision": 1514481,
      "line": 97,
      "start": 56,
      "quote": "時人爲之語曰：「謝有覽舉，王有養炬。」炬是泰，養卽筠，並小字也",
      "sha256": "a9b1993fd0027d649219782c71e5bcb1c74e2b8049d907308b609b089543eb0b",
      "note": "梁書王筠傳與南史王泰傳互易兩個小字。"
    },
    {
      "path": "source-evidence/nanshi022-wangci/external/liang37-ws1506955.wikitext",
      "revision": 1506955,
      "line": 11,
      "start": 59,
      "quote": "世人爲之語曰：「王有養、炬，謝有覽、舉。」養、炬，王筠、王泰小字也。",
      "sha256": "fd9d36071c43a4e2ca08e94dbba8cbf47081d6f83deb41e11702e2b803e7f2db",
      "note": "謝舉傳歸於世人，按前後列次同梁33。"
    },
    {
      "path": "source-evidence/nanshi022-wangci/external/qi35-ws2401782.wikitext",
      "revision": 2401782,
      "line": 59,
      "start": 9,
      "quote": "高宗殺諸王，鋒遺書誚責",
      "sha256": "2c4a8a948c856f9465afe3cfbf503cd4ebc9037abf8a5ef73a1957b91ee6dcbf",
      "note": "高宗與鋒。"
    },
    {
      "path": "source-evidence/nanshi022-wangci/external/qi35-ws2401782.wikitext",
      "revision": 2401782,
      "line": 59,
      "start": 85,
      "quote": "於是敢近者遂逼害之。時年二十",
      "sha256": "2c4a8a948c856f9465afe3cfbf503cd4ebc9037abf8a5ef73a1957b91ee6dcbf",
      "note": "鋒被殺、報齡二十。"
    },
    {
      "path": "source-evidence/nanshi022-wangci/external/qi5-ws1767525.wikitext",
      "revision": 1767525,
      "line": 13,
      "start": 0,
      "quote": "延興元年秋七月丁酉，即皇帝位",
      "sha256": "acb70c64b51623ed9e4d80279274cf91648e3d2253f9dd2cccfa934d4bb3bd4f",
      "note": "海陵王延興元年。"
    },
    {
      "path": "source-evidence/nanshi022-wangci/external/qi5-ws1767525.wikitext",
      "revision": 1767525,
      "line": 19,
      "start": 230,
      "quote": "戊戌，誅新除中軍將軍桂陽王鑠、撫軍將軍衡陽王鈞、侍中祕書監江夏王鋒",
      "sha256": "acb70c64b51623ed9e4d80279274cf91648e3d2253f9dd2cccfa934d4bb3bd4f",
      "note": "冬十月戊戌殺鋒。"
    },
    {
      "path": "source-evidence/nanshi022-wangci/external/sui26-ws2626560.wikitext",
      "revision": 2626560,
      "line": 31,
      "start": 18,
      "quote": "天監七年，乙太常為太常卿",
      "sha256": "9a2a8f64440908eaeb21668477b2d573f2f0fae90dccbd5639ba051bf8a2975c",
      "note": "諸卿加卿的年。固定本原字作乙。"
    },
    {
